: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">수강신청은 학생의 성적처리 및 졸업에 관련되는 중요한 사항이므로 수업시간표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">수강신청 안내자료 등을 충분히 숙지하여 수강신청 하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -22.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">본인의 수강신청 소홀 및 대리수강신청 등으로 인하여 불이익을 당하는 일이 없도록 꼭 유의하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -22.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">논문과정생들은 논문연구 과목 이수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">산업대학원생은&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">공통기초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">과목 수강신청이 누락되지 않도록 유의하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: bold; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">신청경로&nbsp;</span